{"seq":8,"slug":"lc0053-maximum-subarray","title":"LeetCode 53 最大子数组和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0053-maximum-subarray","wordCount":909,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-53-最大子数组和\">LeetCode 53 最大子数组和</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个整数数组 <code>nums</code>，请你找出一个具有最大和的连续子数组（子数组最少包含一个元素），返回其最大和。</p>\n<p><strong>子数组</strong>是数组中的一个连续部分。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^4 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]&#10;输出：6&#10;解释：连续子数组 [4, -1, 2, 1] 的和最大，为 6\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：连续子数组 [4, -1, 2, 1] 的和最大，为 6</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1]&#10;输出：1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：1</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [5, 4, -1, 7, 8]&#10;输出：23\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [5, 4, -1, 7, 8]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：23</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>进阶：</strong> 如果你已经实现复杂度为 <code>O(n)</code> 的解法，尝试使用更为精妙的<strong>分治法</strong>求解。</p>\n<p>最大子数组和是动态规划的入门级经典题目，同时也是 Kadane 算法的标准应用场景。这个算法展示了一个核心思想：用局部最优推导全局最优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"kadane-算法\">Kadane 算法</h3><p>Kadane 算法的核心思想非常简洁：</p>\n<p><strong>对于每个位置 <code>i</code>，以 <code>i</code> 结尾的最大子数组和 = max(以 <code>i-1</code> 结尾的最大子数组和 + nums[i], nums[i])</strong></p>\n<p>换言之，在每个位置上做一个决策：是继续扩展之前的子数组，还是从当前位置重新开始。如果之前的累积和是负数，那还不如从当前位置重新开始。</p>\n<p>状态转移方程：<code>dp[i] = max(dp[i-1] + nums[i], nums[i])</code></p>\n<p>由于 <code>dp[i]</code> 只依赖 <code>dp[i-1]</code>，可以用一个变量代替整个数组，空间优化到 O(1)。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么-kadane-算法是正确的\">为什么 Kadane 算法是正确的</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情况</th>\n<th>currentSum + nums[i] vs nums[i]</th>\n<th>决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>currentSum ≥ 0</td>\n<td>currentSum + nums[i] ≥ nums[i]</td>\n<td>继续扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>currentSum &lt; 0</td>\n<td>currentSum + nums[i] &lt; nums[i]</td>\n<td>重新开始</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当 <code>currentSum</code> 为负时，它对后续只有「拖累」作用，不可能使总和更大。因此丢弃之前的累积，从当前元素重新开始一定不会错过最优解。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分治法\">分治法</h3><p>将数组一分为二，最大子数组要么完全在左半部分，要么完全在右半部分，要么跨越中点。跨越中点的最大子数组可以通过从中点分别向左右扩展来求解。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力枚举</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>理解问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kadane 算法</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>最优解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分治法</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>理解递归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀和</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>另一种视角</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"kadane-算法-推荐\">Kadane 算法（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxSubArray(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  let currentSum = nums[0];&#10;  let maxSum = nums[0];&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; nums.length; i++) {&#10;    currentSum = Math.max(currentSum + nums[i], nums[i]);&#10;    maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, currentSum);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxSum;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxSubArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currentSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(currentSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i], nums[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxSum, currentSum);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxSum;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"动态规划显式写法\">动态规划显式写法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxSubArray(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  const dp = new Array&lt;number&gt;(n);&#10;  dp[0] = nums[0];&#10;  let maxSum = dp[0];&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    dp[i] = Math.max(dp[i - 1] + nums[i], nums[i]);&#10;    maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, dp[i]);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxSum;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxSubArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dp[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i], nums[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxSum, dp[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxSum;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Kadane 算法执行过程：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>i</th>\n<th>nums[i]</th>\n<th>currentSum + nums[i]</th>\n<th>nums[i]</th>\n<th>currentSum</th>\n<th>maxSum</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>-2+1=-1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>1+(-3)=-2</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>-2+4=2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>4+(-1)=3</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3+2=5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>5+1=6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>-5</td>\n<td>6+(-5)=1</td>\n<td>-5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1+4=5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 i=6 时达到最大值 6，对应子数组 <code>[4, -1, 2, 1]</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"前缀和视角\">前缀和视角</h3><p>最大子数组和等价于求 <code>prefixSum[j] - prefixSum[i]</code> 的最大值（<code>j &gt; i</code>）。遍历时维护前缀和的最小值即可：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxSubArray(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  let prefixSum = 0;&#10;  let minPrefix = 0;&#10;  let maxSum = -Infinity;&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    prefixSum += num;&#10;    maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, prefixSum - minPrefix);&#10;    minPrefix = Math.min(minPrefix, prefixSum);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxSum;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxSubArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prefixSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minPrefix </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prefixSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxSum, prefixSum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minPrefix);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    minPrefix </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(minPrefix, prefixSum);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxSum;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kadane</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>一次遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DP 数组</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>需要额外数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀和</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>等价于 Kadane</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> Kadane 算法只需一次遍历，每步做常数次比较和赋值，总时间 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> 优化后只使用 <code>currentSum</code> 和 <code>maxSum</code> 两个变量，空间为 O(1)。DP 数组版本需要 O(n) 空间。</p>\n<p><strong>Kadane 算法的变体应用：</strong> 这一算法模式可以扩展到许多变体问题。LC #152（最大子数组乘积）需要同时维护最大值和最小值（因为负负得正）。LC #918（环形子数组的最大和）需要考虑跨越数组首尾的情况。理解 Kadane 算法的核心——「局部最优决策推导全局最优」——是解决这些变体的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 53 最大子数组和","id":"leetcode-53-最大子数组和"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"Kadane 算法","id":"kadane-算法"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么 Kadane 算法是正确的","id":"为什么-kadane-算法是正确的"},{"level":3,"text":"分治法","id":"分治法"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"Kadane 算法（推荐）","id":"kadane-算法-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"动态规划显式写法","id":"动态规划显式写法"},{"level":3,"text":"前缀和视角","id":"前缀和视角"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 48 旋转图像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0048-rotate-image"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 54 螺旋矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0054-spiral-matrix"}}